OL,3,AForced to call him 'Dad': Trial over
OL,4,Asexual abuse in disabled care home
OL,5,Ashocks South Korea
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I was hurting inside, so I came to
OL,8,Ftell my story."
OL,10,FThese were Seo Mi-hyeon's first words
OL,11,Fto the police.
OL,13,FSeo, who has an intellectual
OL,14,Fdisability, struggles to form long
OL,15,Fsentences and can only communicate
OL,16,Fthrough brief words and gestures. But
OL,17,Fher memories of the abuse inflicted
OL,18,Fupon her were clear.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
