OL,3,AForced to call him 'Dad': Trial over
OL,4,Asexual abuse in disabled care home
OL,5,Ashocks South Korea
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was one of three residents at a
OL,8,Fstate-run care home in South Korea who
OL,9,Fwere sexually assaulted by the home's
OL,10,Fdirector, in a case that has shocked
OL,11,Fthe country and raised serious
OL,12,Fquestions about state care for the
OL,13,Fdisabled.
